The first semantics now compiles on the installed K 7.1 toolchain. Its execution rule is tied to the complete translated AST (so changing `solution.mpy` breaks recognition), while the runtime meaning separately models decimal digit scanning, stable filtering of duplicates, and numeric insertion sort. I’m moving on to concrete `krun` checks before introducing proof claims.
